<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective June 24.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     23.89     24.77	  4.35-9.59  3.91-9.15</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     23.89     24.77	  4.16-9.16  3.72-8.72</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     27.55     27.55	 11.46	11.46</p>
<p> White sugar	  27.55     27.55	  6.94	 6.94</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.28	0.28	  0.37	 0.37</p>
</text>
